    "synopsis": "Princess Stefanie spent her life one step from the throne, only to be murdered just before her coronation by those she trusted most. Reborn as an infant in a remote border town with all her memories as a princess, she discovers her killers have seized the empire and risen to ultimate power. Worse, she finds herself surrounded by the children of her very betrayers. She may be trapped in a helpless baby's body, but she still has her sharp mind. Now, Stefanie must carefully plot her revenge while growing up among the offspring of those who had destroyed her. (Source: Tappytoon)",
